TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1113887354,"text":"この身が顕現したということは、血枝珊瑚は海祇の手に渡ったということですね。安心しました。","nextNodeIds":[722750102]},{"nodeId":722750102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":823589898,"text":"私はエレボス、稲妻式の名を烏帽子と申します。珊瑚宮の補佐官であり、淵下宮の巫女の一人です。","nextNodeIds":[722750103]},{"nodeId":722750103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":4207984338,"text":"あなたが、珊瑚の枝を手にした勇者ですね？","nextNodeIds":[722750104]},{"nodeId":722750104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":955596354,"text":"うん。","nextNodeIds":[722750105]},{"nodeId":722750105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":3492708546,"text":"先に断っておきますが、これからお話しすることは、複雑すぎてどこから話せばいいのか困るほどのものです。","nextNodeIds":[722750106]},{"nodeId":722750106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2360248490,"text":"そうなのか、なら最初から順に話してくれ。オイラたち、最後までちゃんと聞くからさ。","nextNodeIds":[722750107]},{"nodeId":722750107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":3491936834,"text":"ありがとうございます。では、事情を説明したいと思います。すべては、海祇大御神が海淵の門を開いたことから始まりました。","nextNodeIds":[722750108]},{"nodeId":722750108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":4174620194,"text":"淵下宮の深部には天然の鍾乳洞があり、海祇島へ繋がっています。そして海祇島は、海祇によって約束された地上の楽土でもあります。","nextNodeIds":[722750109]},{"nodeId":722750109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1274601586,"text":"我々は大御神の命により、鳴神の文化を学び、その土地と外交関係を築きました。","nextNodeIds":[722750110]},{"nodeId":722750110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1923767466,"text":"ちなみに、鳴神島の人々は我々のことを「海祇美人」と呼んでいました。なぜなら、我々海祇人の肌はきめ細かく、隠しきれない七種の穢れが目立たないためです。","nextNodeIds":[722750111]},{"nodeId":722750111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":4201826026,"text":"我々も先祖も淵下宮で生活していたことにより、日差しを浴びる機会がなく…","nextNodeIds":[722750112,722750113]},{"nodeId":722750112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3657608002,"text":"要点だけ話してほしい。","nextNodeIds":[722750114]},{"nodeId":722750114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":3973761898,"text":"あっ、すみません。以前諸国と外交を行っていた頃、珊瑚宮の補佐官として色々と案内していたので…つい…","nextNodeIds":[722750115]},{"nodeId":722750115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":826265714,"text":"話を戻します。あの時、私と珊瑚宮様の間に、意見の食い違いが生じていました。海祇大御神の仲介により、今の案が生まれたのです。","nextNodeIds":[722750116]},{"nodeId":722750116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":269381962,"text":"淵下宮には、「罪影」と呼ばれる現象があります。それによって「過去」や「歴史」、「真相」といったものが永遠に残り続けます。","nextNodeIds":[722750117]},{"nodeId":722750117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1427333066,"text":"だからでしょう、我々が望むのは「心に銘じる」ことではなく、「忘れる」ことだと珊瑚宮様は考えたのです。","nextNodeIds":[722750118]},{"nodeId":722750118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1747347594,"text":"（ここで言ってる珊瑚宮って、たぶんすごく昔の珊瑚宮の巫女のことだろうな…）","nextNodeIds":[722750119]},{"nodeId":722750119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1837523066,"text":"珊瑚の枝の試練も、あとから来た者が極力真相を知ることがないよう設計されています。","nextNodeIds":[722750120]},{"nodeId":722750120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":169952522,"text":"しかし、私は真相を残すべきだと思いました。その結果、海祇大御神が新たに試練を追加し、それを通過した者にだけ秘密を明かすことにしたのです。","nextNodeIds":[722750121]},{"nodeId":722750121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":1147897690,"text":"この試練、お受けいただけますでしょうか。","nextNodeIds":[722750122,722750123]},{"nodeId":722750122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2826523074,"text":"試練を受ける。","nextNodeIds":[722750124]},{"nodeId":722750124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20341,"speakerName":"烏帽子","textMapHash":3878634498,"text":"はい。では、追加の試練を開始させていただきます。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722750123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1284206330,"text":"秘密に興味がある。","nextNodeIds":[722750124]},{"nodeId":722750113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":999087410,"text":"その話は置いといて、要点を…","nextNodeIds":[722750114]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7227501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7227507,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":246682476,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7227507,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7227507,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["5","121"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ADD_SCENE_TAG"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_ST